513387174_6309677956656533310_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RCYQSjrRKtEQ7kNvwF_F497&_nc_oc=AdpVvb4ySKulmJqIOxS-GG7hvFB0WqAMuQki34bPncH1WjatmLq-ziJgHD9O2nfJRvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM4UlnoK_krVn1-7RMC85ipmppOdTcpLvnvC1tltEmKNQ&oe=6AE0BFB7"}, {"file_name": "4002_\u526f\u672c.png", "id": "1562662179222224", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499621314_1562662182555557_4382440061655504104_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jRGk6y3tPwgQ7kNvwFlTAvo&_nc_oc=AdryNYswIqXmKVEdbDo7duQCUyqj3u6OUt7z7jA6IJCcNjlrtMpY4wBqFSURo3LWlzA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqoyH89q-9vNh_mllFP0w0LbHCb_G5qqOvGacnvQzXGg&oe=6AE0B18F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2K.png", "id": "1042090875446512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_1042090878779845_1119689535618184987_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RPsWn7UiOzQQ7kNvwGGa5Do&_nc_oc=AdqulesB3hk-mNl6W92T2G-OBhBzNzgxq4TxetJeOuhJdzippnp-iipKuN9q_FhvYW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOp0G8eAMe8tg7SFOcFRXNpTdO-G_jDePSrqGtSsCoHyQ&oe=6AE0C44C"}, "display_name": "The Cinder Pact", "keywords": ["Rogue", "Coop", "Hangout", "Social", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "STRATEGIC CO-OP RPG: SURVIVE THE HORDE\n\nYour journey begins with intense hold-the-line battles, quickly opening up to diverse theme dungeons and complex mazes. This is a true Class-Based RPG where ranged firepower, class synergy, and mana management dictate survival. Team up and bond with players worldwide in the ultimate social dungeon-crawling experience!  \n\nTHE FOUR LEGENDS\n\nDefine the battlefield with unique primary attacks and two active skills:  The Armored: Frontline DPS with heavy firepower and raw physical destruction.  The Healer: Team core. Channel holy light to sustain allies and turn the tide.  The Mechanic: Technology master. Deploy tactical gadgets and unleash stunning electrical arcs.  The Summoner: Void commander. Call forth loyal minions and manipulate dark energies.  \n\nCYAN CRYSTAL JADE & PROGRESSION\n\nConquer deep labyrinths to harvest Cyan Crystal Jade, the core material needed to ascend your character. Customize your build through 7 distinct attributes: ATK, Max HP, Max MP, DEF, Movement Speed, and specialized Skill Power (Skill 1 & Skill 2). Manage your Mana (MP) wisely\u2014every cast is a tactical decision.  \n\nZERO GRIND, ALL THRILLS\n\nFast-Start: Complete the 10-minute tutorial and jump directly to Level 5, unlocking your first core skill.  Epic Scale: Brace for massive, multi-wave assaults pushing teamwork and social coordination to the limit.  True F2P: No pay-to-win. Only high-quality, full-model Avatar skins are for sale to showcase your style in social hubs.  ", "short_description": "Dive into a 4-player VR Co-op RPG! Choose from 4 unique classes, master powerful ranged skills, and conquer evolving labyrinths and dungeons. Experience deep RPG mechanics and a vibrant social hub in this 100% Free-to-Play adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/TheCinderPact.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "App Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": 